WEBVTT

00:28.800 --> 00:30.030
-Master.
-Master.

00:31.280 --> 00:32.520
-Master.
-Master.

00:32.750 --> 00:33.430
Master.

00:34.270 --> 00:34.800
Master.

00:35.360 --> 00:36.010
The Young Master...

00:36.010 --> 00:37.140
The Young Master...

00:41.000 --> 00:42.530
Master, be careful.

00:46.840 --> 00:48.200
What happened?

00:48.460 --> 00:49.540
Where is Yuanfan?

00:49.950 --> 00:50.700
Master,

00:50.720 --> 00:53.340
when I got here,
the Young Master was already gone.

00:53.340 --> 00:55.450
All I found was the blood left on the bed.

00:55.450 --> 00:58.250
Get everyone in the Salt Gang
to look for my son!

00:58.390 --> 00:59.320
Yes, Master.

00:59.450 --> 01:00.320
Wait!

01:01.120 --> 01:01.800
Master.

01:01.920 --> 01:03.750
Go find those sorcerers!

01:04.120 --> 01:05.840
If they dare to deceive me,

01:05.840 --> 01:08.000
I will skin them alive!

02:49.020 --> 02:52.710
[A Prophet]

02:53.520 --> 02:55.610
[Episode 21]

02:58.590 --> 02:59.310
Master.

02:59.590 --> 03:00.560
They are back.

03:01.030 --> 03:03.160
They said they prepared a gift for you.

03:04.710 --> 03:05.630
Come on in.

03:11.170 --> 03:11.900
Sect Master.

03:12.800 --> 03:13.530
Sect Master.

03:16.300 --> 03:17.230
What an eyesore.

03:18.150 --> 03:19.550
Send him to the woodshed.

03:38.630 --> 03:40.030
The weather is changing.

03:40.430 --> 03:41.890
I guess it's going to rain.

03:46.590 --> 03:48.000
In a few hours,

03:49.590 --> 03:51.850
the Salt Gang will come out in full force.

03:52.680 --> 03:54.210
There are hundreds of them,

03:54.590 --> 03:56.320
and every one of them can fight.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.680
Our Tianxiang Sect

03:57.910 --> 03:59.570
is probably doomed this time.

04:02.030 --> 04:04.630
Why didn't you
just kill Shangguan Chengming?

04:04.750 --> 04:05.800
If you killed him,

04:06.280 --> 04:08.310
we could just end this.

04:11.870 --> 04:13.400
Cut the crap.

04:14.080 --> 04:16.810
It's all because someone tried to use me
as a pawn.

04:18.430 --> 04:19.070
Really?

04:20.269 --> 04:21.070
Who?

04:22.060 --> 04:22.940
How did it go?

04:23.870 --> 04:25.190
I turned a killing trap

04:25.930 --> 04:27.390
into a money-making trap.

04:27.940 --> 04:29.210
I wonder if you like it.

04:29.360 --> 04:30.610
I like making money.

04:31.270 --> 04:32.200
Tell me about it.

04:32.240 --> 04:33.510
Given Zhang Yinhua's tuberculosis,

04:33.510 --> 04:35.240
he won't last more than a month.

04:35.280 --> 04:36.940
Even if we trap Li Ling's soul,

04:37.260 --> 04:38.920
when Zhang Yinhua ends up dead

04:39.360 --> 04:40.430
and word gets out,

04:40.640 --> 04:42.300
how can others still trust us?

04:43.000 --> 04:44.770
The double-sided trap
can last for 50 years,

04:44.770 --> 04:46.430
all thanks to your foresight—

04:47.159 --> 04:48.760
we do soul-trapping rituals

04:48.830 --> 04:50.560
for whoever can make a fortune.

04:50.560 --> 04:51.510
Now,

04:51.530 --> 04:53.210
Zhang Yinhua is about to fall.

04:53.240 --> 04:55.360
You're only worried about

04:55.750 --> 04:57.680
how to keep this up after his death.

04:58.040 --> 04:58.990
Exactly.

04:59.430 --> 05:00.360
And then?

05:00.980 --> 05:03.760
Zhang Yuanfan will be
the future head of the Zhang family.

05:03.760 --> 05:05.630
As long as he trusts us completely,

05:05.630 --> 05:07.120
this trap will not end

05:07.600 --> 05:08.830
for the next 50 years.

05:09.190 --> 05:10.560
Then what do you plan to do?

05:10.560 --> 05:12.360
I hope you can do me a small favor.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.760
Arrange a killing trap?

05:20.120 --> 05:20.920
No killing.

05:57.560 --> 05:58.190
Master.

06:01.830 --> 06:02.750
You're here.

06:04.830 --> 06:06.430
I was just pondering over it.

06:08.000 --> 06:09.680
I watched you grow up.

06:10.040 --> 06:12.830
Among the Batous in our sect,

06:13.390 --> 06:15.240
you're the quickest-witted.

06:15.680 --> 06:17.160
You can both figure out the bigger picture

06:17.160 --> 06:18.800
and get small things done efficiently.

06:18.800 --> 06:21.270
You've made me plenty of money

06:21.870 --> 06:24.950
and also caused me as much trouble.

06:27.480 --> 06:28.070
Master.

06:29.430 --> 06:30.390
I was wrong.

06:32.470 --> 06:33.800
What did you do wrong?

06:34.390 --> 06:36.120
I shouldn't have saved Li Ling.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.240
So you mean this.

06:42.920 --> 06:45.450
It seems that
you've saved more than just her.

06:50.240 --> 06:50.970
Sect Master.

06:52.070 --> 06:53.630
Liu Xijiao and the others

06:54.070 --> 06:56.240
were all carefully trained
by the sect for years.

06:56.240 --> 06:57.800
It would be such a pity for them
to die in the trap.

06:57.800 --> 06:58.920
How about we let them flee first?

06:58.920 --> 06:59.950
And when our sect

06:59.950 --> 07:01.600
needs them,

07:01.600 --> 07:02.870
we can get them back to serve.

07:02.870 --> 07:04.390
Also, please rest assured,

07:04.390 --> 07:05.870
they have all sworn on their lives

07:05.870 --> 07:07.430
never to reveal a word about it.

07:07.430 --> 07:08.240
Look at you.

07:08.830 --> 07:09.830
Impressive.

07:10.510 --> 07:12.640
You're far-sighted and considerate.

07:13.120 --> 07:13.850
Sect Master,

07:14.720 --> 07:16.780
I am willing to accept my punishment.

07:20.070 --> 07:22.270
Let me show you something interesting.

07:28.750 --> 07:30.950
You gave this to Liu Xijiao, didn't you?

07:33.270 --> 07:35.470
Seems like she doesn't need it anymore.

08:06.140 --> 08:09.590
[Verdict from the Underworld]

08:45.960 --> 08:47.360
Are you a human or a ghost?

08:48.910 --> 08:50.080
Where am I?

08:50.360 --> 08:52.240
City God Temple,

08:52.610 --> 08:56.140
the first pass to the underworld.

08:56.230 --> 08:57.470
Stop fooling me!

08:57.560 --> 08:58.790
I was sleeping at home.

08:58.790 --> 08:59.790
Then I woke up and ended up here.

08:59.790 --> 09:00.790
How did I die?

09:00.790 --> 09:01.790
Tell me!

09:03.270 --> 09:04.600
Everyone...

09:06.020 --> 09:07.620
Says so.

09:18.720 --> 09:19.440
Master,

09:20.010 --> 09:22.540
I ran into a female ghost
by chance yesterday.

09:22.670 --> 09:24.390
She was trapped in the mortal world

09:24.390 --> 09:26.040
and begged me to take her back.

09:26.040 --> 09:28.170
Not until I took her back to this family

09:28.270 --> 09:29.510
did I realize

09:29.630 --> 09:31.440
that her soul was trapped.

09:31.720 --> 09:33.910
I want to help the Zhang family
handle this,

09:33.910 --> 09:35.320
but my power is not strong enough.

09:35.320 --> 09:36.790
Master, please help me.

09:38.670 --> 09:39.960
This matter of the Zhang family

09:39.960 --> 09:41.360
is not that simple.

09:41.440 --> 09:43.120
I need to think it through.

09:44.030 --> 09:46.670
Yuanfan...

09:47.550 --> 09:50.080
I suffered so much...

09:51.870 --> 09:53.790
Yuanfan.

09:55.200 --> 09:57.150
Yuanfan...

09:58.120 --> 09:59.510
You betrayed me.

10:01.000 --> 10:02.150
Open the door! Help!

10:02.150 --> 10:03.510
Yuanfan.

10:03.550 --> 10:04.150
Open the door! Help!

10:04.150 --> 10:05.550
You put me through this.

10:05.790 --> 10:07.120
Open the door!

10:07.320 --> 10:08.200
Help!

10:09.720 --> 10:11.030
Yuanfan...

10:11.030 --> 10:12.320
Don't come over!

10:12.480 --> 10:13.720
Open the door! Help!

10:14.440 --> 10:15.670
Master, open the door!

10:15.670 --> 10:17.150
Help! Help!

10:17.150 --> 10:18.150
Master!

10:29.750 --> 10:31.510
Master, save me.

10:31.510 --> 10:33.670
I am Zhang Yuanfan, the Young Master
of the Zhang family

10:33.670 --> 10:34.630
you mentioned.

10:35.030 --> 10:36.480
Why are you here?

10:36.500 --> 10:37.950
I was sleeping at home.

10:37.980 --> 10:39.090
I woke up and ended up here!

10:39.090 --> 10:41.370
Yuanfan...

10:42.600 --> 10:44.080
You can see Li Ling?

10:45.390 --> 10:46.850
Isn't she right out there?

10:47.000 --> 10:48.800
Did you drink the talisman water

10:49.000 --> 10:50.400
I gave your Zhang family?

10:50.960 --> 10:52.630
I did drink it. I drank it all.

10:52.630 --> 10:54.550
Why did you still end up dead
after drinking it?

10:54.550 --> 10:55.670
I don't know.

10:59.120 --> 11:00.580
Did you pee after drinking

11:00.660 --> 11:01.790
the talisman water?

11:08.150 --> 11:09.750
You can't pee that talisman water out!

11:09.750 --> 11:11.140
Peeing it out would lose its effect!

11:11.140 --> 11:11.940
Master,

11:12.570 --> 11:14.170
how could I hold my pee?

11:19.760 --> 11:22.080
You're already in the City God Temple now.

11:22.080 --> 11:23.960
This is the first pass to the underworld.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.080
Once the door opens,

11:25.080 --> 11:26.300
take your verdict,

11:26.320 --> 11:27.510
remove your living registration,

11:27.510 --> 11:28.910
have it stamped with the City God's seal,

11:28.910 --> 11:30.710
and you can go to the underworld.

11:32.550 --> 11:33.630
I'm really dead?

11:35.000 --> 11:36.600
Yuanfan...

11:37.750 --> 11:39.200
Master, Master,

11:39.440 --> 11:41.840
I beg you to take me back
to the mortal world.

11:41.840 --> 11:42.790
As long as you take me back,

11:42.790 --> 11:43.910
my father will pay you

11:43.910 --> 11:44.960
as much as you want!

11:44.960 --> 11:46.480
My father never hesitates
to spend money for me.

11:46.480 --> 11:47.870
I am also a filial son.

11:48.440 --> 11:49.600
I still need to take care of him.

11:49.600 --> 11:50.720
Master, I'm begging you.

11:50.720 --> 11:52.360
Even if I take you back,

11:52.360 --> 11:53.360
in a few days...

11:53.380 --> 11:55.310
Yuanfan...

11:56.160 --> 11:57.820
You will still come down here.

11:59.480 --> 12:01.140
Could it be that
if I ascend to the mortal world,

12:01.140 --> 12:03.170
Li Ling can still
chase me there to kill me?

12:03.170 --> 12:04.740
You killed Li Ling and trapped her soul

12:04.740 --> 12:06.520
soon after she married into your family.

12:06.520 --> 12:08.420
There's no way
she won't cause you trouble.

12:08.420 --> 12:09.900
I had no other choice.

12:10.450 --> 12:12.180
Given my father's poor health,

12:12.200 --> 12:13.600
he couldn't hold on for much longer.

12:13.600 --> 12:14.510
I just talked

12:15.440 --> 12:17.390
to my master about this matter.

12:17.790 --> 12:19.030
If he is willing to lend a hand,

12:19.030 --> 12:20.000
it'll take him

12:20.000 --> 12:23.060
less than 7 days
to annihilate this evil ghost, Li Ling.

12:23.840 --> 12:24.630
However,

12:27.310 --> 12:28.670
Li Ling may not be the one

12:31.510 --> 12:33.240
trying to harm you, I'm afraid.

12:33.960 --> 12:35.360
Then who else could it be?

12:35.940 --> 12:38.260
This person is very close to you.

12:42.240 --> 12:43.120
Xiaomei?

12:44.750 --> 12:45.630
Dingxiang?

12:46.440 --> 12:47.360
Fengxia?

12:47.360 --> 12:48.200
Zhen?

12:48.480 --> 12:49.630
It's your father,

12:50.650 --> 12:51.770
Zhang Yinhua.

12:53.400 --> 12:55.400
He wanted to trap Li Ling's soul
to prolong his lifespan

12:55.400 --> 12:56.240
but failed.

12:56.410 --> 12:58.400
Even if he takes in another concubine now

12:58.400 --> 12:59.530
and treats her well,

12:59.790 --> 13:01.000
his health

13:01.020 --> 13:02.910
probably won't hold out until then.

13:02.910 --> 13:03.960
Therefore,

13:04.030 --> 13:06.960
he wants to trap someone
who is closest to him

13:07.410 --> 13:09.320
and will never betray him.

13:10.630 --> 13:12.270
I am his son.

13:14.010 --> 13:16.440
Our Zhang family has had only one heir
for 3 generations respectively.

13:16.440 --> 13:18.240
Would he end his own bloodline?

13:18.270 --> 13:19.240
Disciple,

13:19.910 --> 13:21.750
we are both cultivators.

13:22.200 --> 13:24.720
Do not interfere
with other people's karma.

13:25.240 --> 13:27.510
Just send him back to the mortal world.

13:27.650 --> 13:29.590
Whether it's a blessing or retribution

13:29.590 --> 13:30.880
depends on his fate.

13:32.760 --> 13:33.950
Thank you, Master!

13:34.050 --> 13:35.250
Thank you, Master!

13:37.590 --> 13:38.400
Go!

13:54.530 --> 13:56.200
Li Ling isn't the only one

13:56.230 --> 13:58.360
trapped in your Zhang family's place.

13:58.450 --> 14:00.180
Do you know these people?

14:06.600 --> 14:07.480
Stepmother?

14:10.270 --> 14:11.400
Second Stepmother?

14:11.870 --> 14:13.000
And Concubine Liu?

14:16.630 --> 14:18.780
They can neither
return to the mortal world

14:18.780 --> 14:20.380
nor go to the underworld now.

14:20.880 --> 14:23.640
They can only wander around here.

14:25.670 --> 14:26.910
Will they hurt me then?

14:26.910 --> 14:27.480
Xijiao?

14:27.480 --> 14:28.340
Yes, of course.

14:29.030 --> 14:30.830
They died for your Zhang family.

14:31.270 --> 14:32.360
If you break into the trap,

14:32.360 --> 14:33.480
we will kill you!

14:34.480 --> 14:34.870
Go!

14:34.950 --> 14:36.160
Why harm me?

14:36.180 --> 14:37.760
My father trapped their souls, not me!

14:37.760 --> 14:38.890
That's why they say,

14:38.900 --> 14:40.530
"A son pays his father's debts."

14:40.530 --> 14:41.980
Isn't trapping souls meant
to protect our family?

14:41.980 --> 14:43.300
It protects your father.

14:43.300 --> 14:45.520
Otherwise, he would have died
20 years ago.

14:45.520 --> 14:47.330
He's got all the boons,

14:47.360 --> 14:48.670
while the banes

14:48.690 --> 14:50.050
are coming to you, of course.

14:50.050 --> 14:51.000
No way, Master.

14:51.510 --> 14:52.270
I beg you.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.080
Please save me, Master.

14:53.080 --> 14:54.010
I'm begging you!

15:08.760 --> 15:10.760
Annihilate their souls,

15:13.060 --> 15:15.190
and you can return to the mortal world.

15:26.840 --> 15:27.510
Yuanfan.

15:29.000 --> 15:29.670
Yuanfan.

15:31.240 --> 15:32.470
I am Concubine Liu,

15:33.240 --> 15:34.200
Xijiao,

15:35.250 --> 15:36.480
Liu Xijiao!

15:41.000 --> 15:42.000
Concubine Liu...

15:42.910 --> 15:43.960
I remember you.

15:44.600 --> 15:45.260
Yuanfan...

15:45.320 --> 15:46.320
Don't come closer.

15:46.320 --> 15:47.580
Don't come any closer.

15:47.750 --> 15:48.550
Stay back.

15:50.720 --> 15:51.380
Yuanfan...

15:52.670 --> 15:53.150
Wait.

15:54.930 --> 15:55.690
Disciple,

15:56.270 --> 15:57.270
let him go.

16:02.510 --> 16:05.310
If my father could use you
to prolong his lifespan,

16:06.130 --> 16:07.560
why can't I?

16:10.510 --> 16:11.480
I want to live.

16:11.670 --> 16:12.670
I want to survive!

16:12.960 --> 16:14.510
A son pays his father's debts.

16:14.510 --> 16:16.320
He's got all the boons,

16:16.320 --> 16:17.150
while the banes...

16:17.150 --> 16:17.550
Yuanfan...

16:17.550 --> 16:19.150
Are coming to you, of course.

16:19.240 --> 16:19.840
Go to hell.

16:20.720 --> 16:22.200
All of you, go to hell!

16:24.240 --> 16:24.840
No!

16:25.200 --> 16:25.790
No!

16:49.890 --> 16:51.040
These three people

16:52.240 --> 16:53.790
are my gift in return to you.

16:54.640 --> 16:56.920
Jiang Feiyan let these female Abaos go.

16:57.270 --> 16:58.790
You know the sect rules.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.840
I've been merciful enough.

17:01.000 --> 17:03.330
I had Chief Batou drug them.

17:03.360 --> 17:04.970
Although they've become deranged,

17:04.970 --> 17:06.930
they can still live for a while.

17:06.960 --> 17:09.369
If they weren't of use to your trap,

17:09.920 --> 17:11.250
they'd already be dead.

17:11.550 --> 17:12.960
They are not pawns!

17:13.030 --> 17:13.920
They are human!

17:14.589 --> 17:16.440
Do you care so little about human lives?

17:16.440 --> 17:18.450
Shout a bit louder, and he will wake up,

17:18.450 --> 17:19.990
and she would have died for nothing.

17:19.990 --> 17:21.450
Trampling on human lives—

17:22.869 --> 17:25.640
is this what the Tianxiang Sect calls
"upholding justice"?

17:25.640 --> 17:27.240
"Upholding justice."

17:28.109 --> 17:29.700
Let me tell you what justice is.

17:29.700 --> 17:31.030
Whoever holds the power

17:31.110 --> 17:32.110
is justice.

17:32.310 --> 17:35.160
Whether I talk sense or nonsense,

17:35.880 --> 17:38.140
as long as people like him all believe it,

17:38.350 --> 17:39.750
that is justice.

17:40.240 --> 17:41.440
I know you can't kill anyone.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.790
You can't do it.

17:43.030 --> 17:44.640
But you must pass this test,

17:44.750 --> 17:46.480
so I had to give you a push.

17:47.030 --> 17:49.030
Didn't we agree not to kill?

17:51.790 --> 17:52.920
Making money

17:54.350 --> 17:55.720
is a bloody business.

18:08.960 --> 18:10.020
When did Liu Xijiao

18:10.830 --> 18:12.000
come back?

18:12.030 --> 18:13.550
This person has nothing to do
with you anymore.

18:13.550 --> 18:14.760
Don't ask about her again.

18:14.760 --> 18:16.360
According to the sect rules,

18:16.570 --> 18:19.000
anyone who wants to leave
must take 3 cuts and 6 stabs.

18:19.000 --> 18:20.270
Today, in front of the Sect Master,

18:20.270 --> 18:21.260
how could they still...

18:21.260 --> 18:23.120
Our Sect Master is soft-hearted.

18:24.750 --> 18:26.720
He gave the girls a chance

18:27.590 --> 18:29.350
to come back and help set a trap.

18:31.400 --> 18:32.200
That's right.

18:32.960 --> 18:33.640
Yes.

18:34.240 --> 18:35.270
After this trap is done,

18:35.270 --> 18:36.750
they will be allowed to leave.

18:36.750 --> 18:37.670
Listen,

18:37.700 --> 18:38.750
this girl will no longer

18:38.750 --> 18:40.470
be a member of our sect.

18:40.500 --> 18:42.930
You and she were just
not meant to be together in this life,

18:42.930 --> 18:43.720
got it?

18:52.270 --> 18:53.240
Let's go.

19:01.880 --> 19:02.940
Glad that she left.

19:04.270 --> 19:05.470
Good to know she left.

19:33.030 --> 19:34.160
Knock as you please.

19:34.550 --> 19:35.480
This one is

19:35.830 --> 19:37.630
made of genuine nanmu wood,

19:37.960 --> 19:39.290
with a 9-inches-thick base

19:39.290 --> 19:40.490
and flawless planks.

19:41.840 --> 19:44.670
It can withstand any amount of knocking.

19:44.970 --> 19:45.770
I knew

19:45.800 --> 19:47.720
you would definitely show mercy

19:47.740 --> 19:49.460
and come buy a coffin for that girl.

19:49.460 --> 19:50.020
See?

19:50.270 --> 19:51.670
I specifically kept the best one

19:51.670 --> 19:52.430
just for you.

19:52.680 --> 19:53.740
It won't cost much.

19:54.790 --> 19:55.920
Just 3 gold bars.

19:55.960 --> 19:57.240
I'll take this coffin.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.000
I'll pay you

19:59.300 --> 20:00.700
when the trap is done.

20:01.720 --> 20:02.510
You really thought

20:02.510 --> 20:04.640
those female Abaos could escape?

20:04.640 --> 20:05.750
You know what?

20:05.960 --> 20:07.960
The Sect Master has been watching you
all along.

20:07.960 --> 20:09.790
The Sect Master has already

20:09.960 --> 20:12.000
seen through your thoughts.

20:13.350 --> 20:14.720
I just don't get it.

20:15.750 --> 20:17.640
If you want to do good deeds,

20:18.160 --> 20:20.480
you can go be a teacher
and join a revolution.

20:20.480 --> 20:21.110
Or at least,

20:21.110 --> 20:22.590
you can go become a monk in the mountains.

20:22.590 --> 20:24.590
Why did you join our Tianxiang Sect?

20:26.160 --> 20:27.890
I just feel sorry for that girl.

20:28.880 --> 20:30.210
What's wrong with that?

20:33.070 --> 20:34.200
Feel sorry for her?

20:36.070 --> 20:37.270
In these times,

20:37.880 --> 20:39.750
the world is awash with pitiful people.

20:39.750 --> 20:41.480
For us swindlers,

20:41.790 --> 20:42.750
if we can

20:42.920 --> 20:45.240
end up lying in a coffin like this,

20:45.830 --> 20:47.830
that will be the greatest blessing.

21:22.110 --> 21:23.720
How bold you are.

21:23.870 --> 21:25.200
How dare you come again?

21:25.590 --> 21:26.590
Where is my son?

21:26.750 --> 21:27.590
I've brought

21:28.130 --> 21:29.890
your son back to you.

21:33.960 --> 21:34.750
Yuanfan.

21:36.510 --> 21:37.350
Yuanfan!

21:37.350 --> 21:39.640
Don't worry, he's fine.

21:45.480 --> 21:47.590
Be careful.

21:48.030 --> 21:49.200
Young Master.

21:49.720 --> 21:50.480
Yuanfan.

21:51.400 --> 21:51.800
My boy.

21:52.200 --> 21:52.720
My boy?

21:55.640 --> 21:56.240
Li Ling...

21:57.590 --> 21:58.750
Li Ling...

21:58.750 --> 22:00.510
Li Ling wants to kill me...

22:02.510 --> 22:03.510
Don't let her come near.

22:03.510 --> 22:05.110
Don't let her come any closer!

22:05.110 --> 22:06.240
Keep her away from me.

22:06.240 --> 22:08.330
Your son just came back
from the underworld.

22:08.330 --> 22:11.090
His soul fragments
haven't fully returned yet.

22:12.260 --> 22:12.980
Yuanfan.

22:13.000 --> 22:13.930
Don't be afraid.

22:14.110 --> 22:15.110
I am here with you.

22:15.160 --> 22:15.790
Tell me

22:16.000 --> 22:16.960
what happened.

22:19.680 --> 22:20.270
Master!

22:20.590 --> 22:21.480
Master!

22:22.310 --> 22:23.070
Master!

22:23.440 --> 22:24.160
Master, I beg you.

22:24.160 --> 22:25.560
You must save me, Master!

22:25.790 --> 22:27.270
I don't want to go back there again!

22:27.270 --> 22:28.270
Master...

22:28.400 --> 22:30.920
You may take your son
back to his room to rest first.

22:30.920 --> 22:32.400
Master, I'm scared...

22:32.510 --> 22:33.110
Master...

22:33.240 --> 22:33.960
Young Master.

22:33.960 --> 22:35.440
Please get up, Young Master.

22:35.440 --> 22:36.440
You're back home.

22:36.790 --> 22:37.350
Save me.

22:37.440 --> 22:38.400
Save me, Master.

22:39.070 --> 22:39.880
Master!

22:47.000 --> 22:47.880
Sir,

22:49.640 --> 22:51.790
you have done a great favor
for our Zhang family.

22:51.790 --> 22:53.890
This is a gift to show our appreciation.

22:53.890 --> 22:54.780
Sir,

22:55.720 --> 22:57.510
I must say something in the first place.

22:57.510 --> 22:58.510
This matter

22:58.960 --> 22:59.820
is not over yet.

23:00.110 --> 23:01.440
Li Ling's soul

23:01.680 --> 23:03.570
is only temporarily suppressed by me.

23:03.570 --> 23:06.070
It will take one week
to completely annihilate it.

23:06.070 --> 23:08.830
Be careful.
Li Ling will come again this week.

23:13.770 --> 23:15.160
She will come again?

23:15.180 --> 23:16.710
She will not only come again

23:16.840 --> 23:19.020
but also take advantage
of your son's weak condition

23:19.020 --> 23:20.470
to occupy his body.

23:20.490 --> 23:22.890
Therefore, you must not mention
the matter of Li Ling

23:22.890 --> 23:24.490
and the soul trapping again.

23:24.880 --> 23:25.880
If you bring it up,

23:26.150 --> 23:28.150
you'll be summoning Li Ling's soul.

23:28.270 --> 23:29.790
Before possessing your son's body,

23:29.790 --> 23:31.640
Li Ling will bind him with evil energy,

23:31.640 --> 23:33.310
leaving scratch marks on his body.

23:33.310 --> 23:36.270
When that happens,
you must keep your son's soul

23:36.320 --> 23:38.470
and not give Li Ling any opportunity.

23:42.240 --> 23:42.640
Tie him up!

23:42.640 --> 23:43.610
What are you doing?

23:43.610 --> 23:45.130
What? What are you doing?

23:45.430 --> 23:46.320
Let me go!

23:46.480 --> 23:48.590
You'll kill yourself scratching like that!

23:48.590 --> 23:50.790
I'm itchy, so I scratch!
What's wrong with that?

23:50.790 --> 23:52.680
Father, tell them to let me go!

23:53.030 --> 23:54.130
I'm itchier when you tie me,

23:54.130 --> 23:54.960
Father!

23:55.030 --> 23:55.680
Hurry up!

23:55.680 --> 23:56.510
I won't scratch anymore.

23:56.510 --> 23:58.000
Just tell them to let me go,

23:58.000 --> 23:58.880
Father!

24:00.000 --> 24:01.160
Let me go!

24:06.110 --> 24:06.640
Master.

24:06.960 --> 24:07.590
Master.

24:09.350 --> 24:11.030
How is he doing now?

24:11.130 --> 24:12.520
As you ordered,

24:12.630 --> 24:14.290
we fed him the talisman water,

24:14.510 --> 24:15.840
and he's been sleeping.

24:16.000 --> 24:18.920
The Young Master's got
ghost scratch marks all over his body,

24:18.920 --> 24:19.920
even on his back

24:19.920 --> 24:22.240
where he can't reach himself!

24:22.390 --> 24:23.780
It must be

24:24.550 --> 24:26.310
Li Ling coming for him.

24:28.490 --> 24:29.620
Have a seat, Master.

24:32.080 --> 24:33.720
I've been taking a turn

24:33.750 --> 24:35.550
for the worse day by day.

24:36.750 --> 24:38.990
Where is the girl I asked you to find?

24:39.440 --> 24:40.510
I'm still working on it.

24:40.510 --> 24:42.040
Why is it so hard to find one?

24:42.400 --> 24:44.590
With my wealth, I can't even find a wife?

24:44.590 --> 24:45.110
Go

24:45.480 --> 24:47.880
buy one from those poor people
who are selling

24:47.880 --> 24:48.880
their daughters.

24:48.960 --> 24:49.690
Understood.

25:20.880 --> 25:21.720
Who is it?

25:50.670 --> 25:51.320
Who?

26:41.440 --> 26:42.370
Don't come over!

26:42.920 --> 26:44.180
Don't come any closer!

26:45.720 --> 26:46.440
Stay back!

26:47.030 --> 26:47.920
Back!

26:48.640 --> 26:49.640
I have money!

26:49.640 --> 26:51.000
I can give you everything!

26:51.000 --> 26:51.830
What are you all doing?

26:51.830 --> 26:52.310
Make way!

26:52.310 --> 26:53.570
Don't come any closer!

26:53.890 --> 26:55.090
-Master.
-Master.

26:55.200 --> 26:56.130
Don't come over!

26:56.680 --> 26:57.590
Stay back!

26:59.150 --> 26:59.980
I have money!

27:00.000 --> 27:01.800
I can give you everything I have!

27:02.070 --> 27:02.640
Please spare me!

27:02.640 --> 27:03.240
Open the door.

27:03.240 --> 27:04.170
Don't come over!

27:13.160 --> 27:13.750
Yuanfan.

27:16.090 --> 27:16.730
Yuanfan!

27:39.310 --> 27:40.110
Li Ling...

27:41.720 --> 27:42.980
Li Ling has come for me.

27:47.200 --> 27:52.180
[Zhang Residence]

27:57.440 --> 27:57.960
What?

27:58.160 --> 27:59.290
Does it disgust you?

27:59.590 --> 28:00.680
You asked me to use eel blood,

28:00.680 --> 28:02.160
and now I stink of it.

28:03.270 --> 28:04.930
Eel blood is the most pungent.

28:05.070 --> 28:06.740
Only by attracting bats
to hit the door this way

28:06.740 --> 28:09.200
could we make it
sound like a ghost knocking.

28:11.900 --> 28:13.500
Guess who I saw the other day?

28:15.200 --> 28:15.640
Who?

28:16.880 --> 28:17.640
Liu Xijiao!

28:19.350 --> 28:20.160
Sect Master

28:20.160 --> 28:21.640
didn't stoop to their level.

28:21.640 --> 28:23.040
He had them help set a trap

28:23.400 --> 28:24.720
and then let them go.

28:26.240 --> 28:27.920
Sect Master is such a nice person,

28:27.920 --> 28:29.120
like a living Buddha.

28:46.550 --> 28:47.750
Young Master...

28:55.710 --> 28:56.510
I have already

28:56.750 --> 28:58.240
chosen the person.

28:58.670 --> 28:59.840
In a few days,

29:00.350 --> 29:01.200
you

29:01.310 --> 29:03.680
can perform the soul-trapping ritual.

29:04.790 --> 29:05.750
I've been watching

29:05.750 --> 29:07.210
this child for a long time.

29:07.240 --> 29:09.350
The child and the father live together

29:09.350 --> 29:10.200
in poverty.

29:10.720 --> 29:12.980
As long as I pay the family
a little money,

29:13.400 --> 29:14.880
the child will definitely follow me...

29:14.880 --> 29:16.680
I think we should just forget it.

29:16.980 --> 29:18.870
It's a very filial child,

29:18.890 --> 29:19.920
young

29:19.950 --> 29:21.540
and promising.

29:22.610 --> 29:24.280
Are you really going to trap
this child's soul?

29:24.280 --> 29:26.010
The child's mother died early.

29:26.710 --> 29:29.490
What's wrong with the child
doing something for the father?

29:29.490 --> 29:31.750
It's a perfect choice for soul trapping.

29:34.490 --> 29:35.640
Close the door.

29:42.050 --> 29:44.790
Li Ling may not be the one
trying to harm you, I'm afraid.

29:44.790 --> 29:46.000
Then who else could it be?

29:46.000 --> 29:47.960
It's your father, Zhang Yinhua.

29:48.340 --> 29:51.020
He can only trap someone
who is closest to him

29:51.590 --> 29:53.350
and will never betray him.

30:03.920 --> 30:05.180
It protects your father.

30:05.180 --> 30:07.480
Otherwise, he would have died
20 years ago.

30:07.480 --> 30:09.240
He's got all the boons,

30:09.260 --> 30:10.120
while the banes

30:10.590 --> 30:12.190
are coming to you, of course.

30:42.790 --> 30:44.720
Where's the handprint on the door?

30:44.830 --> 30:46.440
Where's the handprint on the door?

30:46.440 --> 30:47.750
What handprint?

30:47.940 --> 30:49.580
Li Ling came last night.

30:51.200 --> 30:52.480
The handprint she left

30:53.110 --> 30:54.240
is gone!

30:54.480 --> 30:55.510
It's gone!

31:00.920 --> 31:01.680
Yuanfan.

31:04.070 --> 31:05.070
Look at me.

31:08.760 --> 31:10.280
Do you love me?

31:17.640 --> 31:18.510
My boy, tell me,

31:20.200 --> 31:21.350
do you love me?

31:21.460 --> 31:22.780
Then tell me,

31:25.110 --> 31:26.770
what's that water vat outside

31:27.330 --> 31:28.770
for?

31:32.170 --> 31:33.620
Isn't that used

31:34.040 --> 31:37.000
to make your favorite pickles?

31:37.680 --> 31:38.570
No!

31:39.640 --> 31:40.440
No...

31:40.720 --> 31:42.440
You use it to trap souls.

31:42.830 --> 31:43.590
Trap souls.

31:43.680 --> 31:44.640
Son,

31:45.060 --> 31:46.830
I don't know what you're talking about.

31:46.830 --> 31:47.980
Trap what?

31:48.110 --> 31:51.020
I don't get what you mean.

31:53.550 --> 31:55.080
Do you still remember this?

31:55.720 --> 31:57.460
When you trapped Li Ling's soul,

31:57.460 --> 31:58.390
her body...

31:58.730 --> 32:00.450
her body was covered

32:00.830 --> 32:02.480
with these marks scratched by ghosts.

32:02.480 --> 32:03.550
What did you say?

32:04.880 --> 32:05.750
Who?

32:06.020 --> 32:07.070
My wife...

32:07.090 --> 32:08.650
My wife, Li Ling!

32:08.680 --> 32:10.010
Didn't you trap her soul

32:10.200 --> 32:11.460
to prolong your lifespan?

32:11.460 --> 32:13.990
I don't know the person
you're talking about.

32:18.880 --> 32:20.350
You're not going to live much longer.

32:20.350 --> 32:21.550
You need to find someone.

32:21.550 --> 32:23.080
You can't find anyone else,

32:23.310 --> 32:24.970
so you want to seal my soul now.

32:25.320 --> 32:27.050
You want to trap my soul, right?

32:29.000 --> 32:31.060
What nonsense are you talking about?

32:31.830 --> 32:32.470
Yuanfan,

32:33.270 --> 32:34.720
I love you!

32:35.590 --> 32:37.590
Do you love me?

32:37.960 --> 32:39.760
You've never asked if I love you.

32:41.720 --> 32:42.950
Why the sudden question?

32:42.950 --> 32:44.360
Why are you asking me all of a sudden now?

32:44.360 --> 32:46.430
I just want you to say it!

32:46.550 --> 32:47.600
Do you love me?

32:48.070 --> 32:49.550
Do you love me?

32:49.640 --> 32:51.440
Do you love me?

32:53.510 --> 32:54.240
I love you...

32:55.510 --> 32:57.030
I love you to death!

33:01.000 --> 33:02.370
You must keep your son's soul

33:02.370 --> 33:04.300
before Li Ling possesses his body.

33:04.470 --> 33:06.270
When you are alone with your son,

33:06.400 --> 33:07.030
ask him

33:07.720 --> 33:08.580
if he loves you.

33:09.000 --> 33:11.130
You must stare him straight in the eyes

33:11.270 --> 33:13.470
and make sure he answers this question.

33:17.430 --> 33:19.400
[Yunhe Temple]

33:22.880 --> 33:23.550
Master.

33:24.200 --> 33:25.000
Sir,

33:26.660 --> 33:28.070
why are you doing this?

33:28.120 --> 33:28.950
I want to...

33:33.070 --> 33:34.800
I want to trap my father's soul!

33:40.720 --> 33:41.480
Did I hear you wrong,

33:41.480 --> 33:42.940
or are you out of your mind?

33:43.830 --> 33:45.830
You want to trap your father's soul?

33:47.200 --> 33:50.460
That old man is already
in the late stages of tuberculosis.

33:51.200 --> 33:53.730
Yet he wants to use me
to prolong his lifespan.

33:54.590 --> 33:55.990
I know he's turned to you.

33:56.030 --> 33:57.960
You must have received
a lot of rewards from him.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.110
But it doesn't matter!

33:59.110 --> 34:00.310
Whatever he pays you,

34:00.720 --> 34:01.960
I'll double it.

34:02.790 --> 34:03.480
Good?

34:03.930 --> 34:05.200
He is your father.

34:06.680 --> 34:07.600
Are you sure about this?

34:07.600 --> 34:10.070
There's no father in the world
who doesn't care about his son.

34:10.070 --> 34:11.280
Is he even human?

34:12.400 --> 34:14.230
He always says my mother died early,

34:14.230 --> 34:16.030
and it wasn't easy
for him to raise me alone.

34:16.030 --> 34:18.489
That's because he trapped
my mother's soul.

34:18.550 --> 34:19.440
Therefore,

34:19.920 --> 34:20.880
trapping him

34:21.280 --> 34:22.719
is me upholding justice!

34:23.360 --> 34:25.159
I'll give you 3 more opium shops.

34:25.630 --> 34:26.830
Let's do it together.

34:27.320 --> 34:29.120
Let's uphold justice together.

34:32.110 --> 34:33.570
"Disasters and blessings

34:33.670 --> 34:35.000
are brought by humans."

34:35.150 --> 34:36.409
You must think through

34:38.960 --> 34:40.500
the consequences of this.

34:46.330 --> 34:47.790
I have thought it through.

34:50.280 --> 34:51.510
I'll kill him

34:53.230 --> 34:55.090
and get my hands covered in blood.

34:56.150 --> 34:57.030
And I'm leaving

34:59.030 --> 35:00.360
the rest to you, Master.

35:03.840 --> 35:04.590
Master!

35:06.960 --> 35:07.890
Young Master...

35:07.920 --> 35:08.670
The cellar!

35:11.260 --> 35:12.480
Stop that brat now!

35:13.490 --> 35:14.740
Be careful, Master.

35:21.150 --> 35:21.920
Master.

35:22.590 --> 35:23.050
Master.

35:29.230 --> 35:30.000
Yuanfan.

35:31.370 --> 35:32.080
My boy?

35:32.880 --> 35:33.550
Yuanfan!

36:01.440 --> 36:02.240
Young Master.

36:07.280 --> 36:08.080
Young Master.

36:10.840 --> 36:11.640
Young Master.

36:14.640 --> 36:15.230
Murder!

36:15.320 --> 36:16.240
Murder!

36:27.050 --> 36:27.900
Yuanfan,

36:28.710 --> 36:29.110
my boy.

36:30.710 --> 36:31.780
I am Zhang Yinhua.

36:32.470 --> 36:33.550
I am Zhang Yinhua.

36:34.070 --> 36:35.030
Zhang Yinhua!

36:36.550 --> 36:37.610
What are you doing?

36:37.880 --> 36:38.810
Don't come over!

36:39.820 --> 36:41.260
I am your father!

36:42.230 --> 36:43.760
And you still want to kill me

36:45.760 --> 36:46.690
and trap my soul?

36:46.960 --> 36:48.400
What nonsense are you talking about?

36:48.400 --> 36:50.360
Stop playing dumb with me!

36:53.820 --> 36:54.840
What is this?

37:10.760 --> 37:12.220
And what are these things?

37:12.290 --> 37:14.040
Tell me, what are these?

37:19.440 --> 37:20.000
Father,

37:20.760 --> 37:21.480
tell me.

37:26.320 --> 37:27.190
Do you love me?

37:30.610 --> 37:31.980
Do you love me?

37:35.170 --> 37:37.120
Yes, I love you...

37:39.440 --> 37:40.840
The entire Zhang family

37:42.320 --> 37:43.230
will be mine.

37:44.320 --> 37:45.320
Since you love me,

37:46.920 --> 37:47.630
Father,

37:52.070 --> 37:53.440
just stay here

37:53.980 --> 37:56.140
and bless me with wealth and glory!

38:14.740 --> 38:16.230
♪ The lantern waits for one ♪

38:16.250 --> 38:17.730
♪ Who won't return ♪

38:17.760 --> 38:20.730
♪ My eyes hide a sorrow beyond words ♪

38:20.930 --> 38:22.990
♪ I ask for too much ♪

38:23.020 --> 38:24.900
♪ Then blame fate ♪

38:25.150 --> 38:27.650
♪ One step, one trap, one fall ♪

38:27.670 --> 38:30.880
♪ Greed turns into a chain
to trap the old love ♪

38:31.120 --> 38:34.400
♪ Play with fire, yet people's foolishness
will never burn away ♪

38:34.420 --> 38:38.150
♪ Who pretends to be a saint
in front of others ♪

38:38.170 --> 38:43.400
♪ Yet turns around
and wallows in the mundane world? ♪

38:48.000 --> 38:54.070
♪ My greed burns away who I am ♪

38:54.740 --> 39:00.200
♪ My anger clouds what I hold dear ♪

39:01.240 --> 39:07.560
♪ My obsession keeps me
from turning back ♪

39:07.580 --> 39:13.810
♪ I keep my heart closed ♪

39:21.150 --> 39:22.760
Let me go!

39:50.000 --> 39:51.960
You're making me
clean up your mess again, huh?

39:51.960 --> 39:53.000
This case

39:53.280 --> 39:56.210
is enough for you to claim credit
with Director Wang.

39:57.700 --> 39:59.490
You may be nosy,

40:00.670 --> 40:01.960
but you're always doing

40:01.960 --> 40:03.320
righteous things.

40:03.570 --> 40:04.760
Why does a person like you

40:04.760 --> 40:05.440
have to

40:05.440 --> 40:07.170
stay with a bunch of swindlers?

40:08.070 --> 40:10.030
You've also diligently
worked on various cases

40:10.030 --> 40:11.560
in Yucheng, Detective Guo.

40:11.760 --> 40:13.280
Why does a person like you

40:14.150 --> 40:15.070
have to

40:15.400 --> 40:16.880
work for Director Wang?

40:17.390 --> 40:18.750
Drink tea as you please,

40:19.080 --> 40:20.480
but don't talk nonsense.

40:31.580 --> 40:34.550
[Tomb of Liu Xijiao]

40:34.800 --> 40:35.840
What's this?

40:38.950 --> 40:40.150
Didn't Xijiao leave?

40:44.070 --> 40:44.710
Liang,

40:45.440 --> 40:46.550
There's something I never knew

40:46.550 --> 40:47.630
how to tell you.

40:48.760 --> 40:49.800
At this point...

40:52.110 --> 40:54.040
I think I should tell you the truth.

40:54.230 --> 40:55.280
Because I don't want to be

40:55.280 --> 40:56.740
a swindler in front of you.

40:58.840 --> 41:01.240
Liu Xijiao wasn't let go
by the Sect Master.

41:02.720 --> 41:04.450
The Sect Master got her killed.

41:04.670 --> 41:06.190
I buried her with my own hands.

41:06.190 --> 41:06.880
No way.

41:07.400 --> 41:08.630
The Sect Master
wouldn't kill the innocent.

41:08.630 --> 41:09.960
The Sect Master wouldn't kill Liu Xijiao!

41:09.960 --> 41:10.590
Liang.

41:10.800 --> 41:12.150
I said, it's impossible!

41:12.150 --> 41:13.480
The Sect Master treats us gofers so well!

41:13.480 --> 41:14.840
Stop lying to yourself.

41:15.360 --> 41:17.090
We experienced
the Soul-Trapping Game together.

41:17.090 --> 41:18.610
If we hadn't saved Li Ling,

41:20.190 --> 41:21.590
she would be dead as well.

41:24.440 --> 41:26.030
The Sect Master has drowned
so many innocent girls

41:26.030 --> 41:27.070
in water vats

41:27.230 --> 41:28.110
just to continue

41:28.110 --> 41:29.970
his scam that has lasted 50 years.

41:47.960 --> 41:48.890
Eight years ago,

41:49.800 --> 41:52.000
the Sect Master set a trap in Jianghuai,

41:52.290 --> 41:54.600
ruining a family of the Wangs.

41:55.350 --> 41:56.080
At that time,

41:56.600 --> 41:59.130
only one person
in the whole family survived.

41:59.170 --> 42:01.800
He saw the bodies
of his younger brother and younger sister

42:01.800 --> 42:03.240
floating on the Nanxi River.

42:02.310 --> 42:08.890
♪ Under the old city wall,
that year the rain fell gently ♪

42:04.360 --> 42:05.720
That only survivor

42:07.550 --> 42:08.480
was me.

42:08.960 --> 42:10.630
At that time, I only wanted to die,

42:09.470 --> 42:15.420
♪ You walked by with an umbrella,
saying loneliness didn't scare you ♪

42:11.280 --> 42:12.550
but I met Jin Buhuan.

42:13.710 --> 42:16.110
He told me the truth
behind the whole thing.

42:16.490 --> 42:22.800
♪ Later, a blade lay hidden
within a smile ♪

42:16.960 --> 42:17.960
Since then,

42:18.880 --> 42:20.760
I've only had one thought in my mind.

42:20.760 --> 42:22.420
As long as I can get revenge...

42:24.050 --> 42:31.300
♪ An impulsive, spiteful remark
cut deep into my heart ♪

42:24.420 --> 42:26.150
I'm willing to learn anything.

42:31.720 --> 42:37.330
♪ You know full well how weak I am ♪

42:32.870 --> 42:33.660
Liang,

42:34.710 --> 42:37.110
about what kind of person
the Sect Master is

42:37.860 --> 42:40.050
♪ Yet you always turn around ♪

42:38.440 --> 42:40.250
and what kind of organization
the Tianxiang Sect is,

42:40.070 --> 42:45.860
♪ Shielding me from
harsh words and cold daggers ♪

42:40.870 --> 42:42.730
you have to see clearly on your own

42:45.960 --> 42:47.280
and think it through.

42:47.000 --> 42:50.460
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

42:50.510 --> 42:53.410
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

42:54.070 --> 42:57.570
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

42:57.600 --> 43:00.160
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

43:00.970 --> 43:04.510
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

43:04.540 --> 43:07.230
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

43:07.930 --> 43:11.320
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

43:11.340 --> 43:16.250
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

43:12.550 --> 43:13.670
I'm sorry...

43:14.760 --> 43:15.590
Xijiao...

43:16.550 --> 43:18.150
I was too stupid.

43:19.630 --> 43:21.440
I didn't protect you well.

43:22.230 --> 43:24.230
I lost you.

43:41.050 --> 43:41.860
Xijiao,

43:42.320 --> 43:43.230
trust me.

43:43.700 --> 43:49.470
♪ By the window,
flowers withers as time passes ♪

43:44.380 --> 43:46.440
I will definitely avenge your death.

43:47.070 --> 43:48.150
Sect Master...

43:50.550 --> 43:56.270
♪ You lean on the door with a smile
and ask how long it takes to let go ♪

43:51.670 --> 43:52.760
Just you wait.

43:55.210 --> 43:56.740
[Jiulongpo Station, Yucheng]

43:57.140 --> 44:04.060
♪ The blade draws near
yet misses every time ♪

44:01.550 --> 44:03.030
Not all girls

44:03.590 --> 44:04.760
can get away clean

44:05.150 --> 44:11.380
♪ The moment you do it,
all that's left is a trembling embrace ♪

44:05.440 --> 44:06.590
like Li Ling.

44:07.230 --> 44:08.440
She sold her house

44:08.920 --> 44:10.720
and can stay in Pangzhou for now.

44:10.920 --> 44:11.800
In the future,

44:12.240 --> 44:15.350
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

44:12.550 --> 44:13.950
she can also go to Nanyang

44:14.030 --> 44:15.070
for peace.

44:15.470 --> 44:17.430
Just one boat ticket to Nanyang

44:15.590 --> 44:18.090
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

44:18.650 --> 44:22.450
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

44:19.280 --> 44:21.480
costs enough to buy a girl from our sect.

44:22.030 --> 44:23.360
I've explained everything

44:22.690 --> 44:25.350
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

44:24.150 --> 44:25.610
about Liu Xijiao to Liang.

44:25.880 --> 44:29.100
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

44:26.510 --> 44:28.370
He'll eventually know the truth,

44:29.320 --> 44:31.850
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

44:29.400 --> 44:30.840
and he deserves to know

44:31.230 --> 44:32.290
what kind of person

44:32.680 --> 44:36.290
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

44:33.190 --> 44:34.720
on earth the Sect Master is.

44:35.320 --> 44:36.600
Did the Sect Master cause you any trouble

44:36.600 --> 44:40.540
♪ I'll hold back and let you go ♪

44:38.230 --> 44:39.560
for saving those girls?

44:39.800 --> 44:40.710
Not yet.

44:41.760 --> 44:43.690
I guess he has more ruthless tricks

44:44.110 --> 44:45.360
waiting for me.

44:46.070 --> 44:47.280
If possible,

44:47.670 --> 44:48.590
I'd rather

44:51.080 --> 44:52.370
die by your hands.

44:53.430 --> 44:54.160
With me here,

44:57.810 --> 44:59.040
you'll be fine.

45:09.500 --> 45:11.750
[In the next episode]

45:11.960 --> 45:14.220
The Fifth Batou and Shangguan Chengming

45:14.320 --> 45:16.140
saved Paozi from the trap.

45:16.160 --> 45:17.280
They were also the ones

45:17.280 --> 45:18.340
who broke the trap.

45:18.760 --> 45:21.220
Breaking the trap
means breaking the rules.

45:22.420 --> 45:24.480
Now you're talking to me about rules?

45:24.590 --> 45:25.510
So what?

45:25.510 --> 45:26.150
Either

45:26.150 --> 45:27.440
you kill Jiang Feiyan,

45:27.880 --> 45:28.630
or

45:29.070 --> 45:30.200
I'll kill both of you

45:31.440 --> 45:32.230
today.

45:32.230 --> 45:34.290
The Tianxiang Sect has another rule.

45:34.330 --> 45:36.370
We run scams for money but don't kill.

45:36.370 --> 45:37.960
According to the rules you mentioned,

45:37.960 --> 45:40.150
shouldn't everyone be killed today?
